  storyText: /* --- NODE MAPPER & NORMALIZER --- */
  narrativeBeats:
  - "TIMBERLINE REGIONAL \u2014"
  - '.map-viewport { height: 350px !important; border-color: var(--accent-blue) !important; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }'
  - You are standing in the ground floor corridor. Emergency halogen lamps cast long shadows across student lockers and barricaded windows. The sound of distant chatter and heavy rain echoes off the linoleum floors.
  - '[ACTIVE RESCUE] Unseal your weapons, requisition heavy ordnance, and roll out with Reyes.'
  - "Sadie's ration prep line.\r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Ration storage crates behind the canteen."
  - Camera monitors and security feeds.
  - Main Entrance / Refugee Intake Area.
  - Sgt. Vance's inspection & weapons desk.
  - Dr. Thorne's triage ward.
  - "Refugee sleeping quarters.\r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Temporary medical overflow / sleeping cots."
  - Personal lockers and duffel storage.
  - "\U0001F9ED CORRIDOR MOVEMENT:"
  - Ascend the West Stairs to Upper Level.
  - Ascend the East Stairs to Upper Level.
  - "setTimeout(function() {\r\n    /* 1. Destroy the PDA map to prevent ID conflicts */\r\n    var pdaMap = document.getElementById(\"tab-map\");\r\n    if (pdaMap) {\r\n        pdaMap.innerHTML = \"[ MAP FEED ROUTED TO MAIN HUD ]\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    /* 2. Set a nice close-up zoom level for the main screen */\r\n    window.svgMapScale = 1.5;\r\n    \r\n    /* 3. Re-trigger the engine's map tracking on the visible map */\r\n    if (State.variables.currentLocation) {\r\n        window.updateMapGlow(State.variables.currentLocation);\r\n    }\r\n}, 150); /* 150ms delay ensures the passage is fully rendered before zooming */"
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
